      "message": "Integer factoring: keep Lean's default autoImplicit=true, as their build does\n\nTheir lakefile.toml sets no Lean options, so their 146 sources elaborate with Lean's\ndefault autoImplicit=true (v4.35.0 src/Lean/Elab/AutoBound.lean). Our generated\nlakefile set false, which could fail the build of any auto-bound implicit. Lead,\n2026-10-30: add the option before the push. Profile field auto_implicit (boolean,\ndefault false) selects the value; only the integer-factoring profile sets it. It\nchanges only how the sources and the frozen challenge elaborate; Comparator still\ncompares the elaborated statement. Tests: 195 pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
